ement/hr-service-delivery/CreateModHRBadges.md","line":881},{"title":"Configure an owning group for a lifecycle event","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/lifecycle-events/configure-lifecycle-event-owning-group.md","line":891},{"title":"For a flow","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/lifecycle-events/configure-hr-lifecycle-event-activity.md","line":939},{"title":"For a flow","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/lifecycle-events/configure-hr-lifecycle-event-activity.md","line":1014},{"title":"Subflows","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/build-workflows/subflows.md","line":1022},{"title":"Configure a schedule content template for a lifecycle event activity","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/lifecycle-events/configure-schedule-content-template-for-lifecycle-event.md","line":1080},{"title":"Configure an owning group for a lifecycle event","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/lifecycle-events/configure-lifecycle-event-owning-group.md","line":1098},{"title":"Configure an owning group for a lifecycle event","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/lifecycle-events/configure-lifecycle-event-owning-group.md","line":1259},{"title":"Configure an owning group for a lifecycle event","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/lifecycle-events/configure-lifecycle-event-owning-group.md","line":1367},{"title":"Collect Employee Input","target":"employee-form-configuration","line":1452},{"title":"hiring","target":"hiring-tab-concept","line":1460},{"title":"Activity","target":"activity-lxp","line":1475},{"title":"Lifecycle Events","target":"hr-lifecycle-events-landing-page-1","line":1476},{"title":"HR service configuration","target":"hr-service-configuration","line":1477},{"title":"Field mappings","target":"field-mappings-sf","line":1478},{"title":"Map fields","target":"map-fields-navex","line":1479},{"title":"HR services","target":"hr-service-administration","line":1480},{"title":"Subflows","target":"flows-ukg","line":1481},{"title":"HR Profile","target":"c_HRProfileRecords","line":1482},{"title":"Collect employee input","target":"employee-form-configuration","line":1483},{"title":"Hiring","target":"hiring-tab-concept","line":1484}],"metadata":{"title":"Configure a lifecycle event activity","description":"Create or modify a lifecycle event activity. Lifecycle Events activities can be approvals, employee tasks, fulfiller activities, notifications, flows, content, or activity containers.Configure a lifecycle event activity that is an approval. Approvals create a to-do for the specified approvers to approve or reject.Configure a lifecycle event activity that is a task for an employee. Employee tasks are assigned to the subject person of the lifecycle event case.Configure a lifecycle event activity that is for a fulfiller. Fulfiller activities are assigned to an agent or fulfiller in a department such as HR, IT, or Facilities.Configure a lifecycle event activity that is a notification. Notifications automate the sending of an email to the specified recipients.Use flow activity parameters on a lifecycle event activity to automatically populate values from a subflow within an activity.Configure a lifecycle event activity that uses a subflow.Use activity field mappings to map information from a field on a table, custom text, or a custom script to a flow input from a subflow.Configure a lifecycle event activity to schedule content. This activity type enables you to deliver relevant and tailored content to employees as part of the lifecycle event. For example, you can push company-related information or a first day at work banner to new hires as part of their onboarding.Configure a lifecycle event activity that is a container for a group of activities. This activity type enables you to manage the dependencies of activities within an activity set. You can use activity containers to order activities, in parallel or sequence, as well as configure multiple activity containers within an activity set.Configure a lifecycle event activity that is a pulse survey. Pulse surveys capture employee feedback.There are multiple ways you can move an activity within an activity set.You can reorder an activity within an activity set for a lifecycle event using different methods.For a lifecycle event case, you can trigger or create an activity from an activity that is in another activity set.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/employee-service-management/lifecycle-events/configure-hr-lifecycle-event-activity.html","release":"australia","product":"Lifecycle Events","classification":"lifecycle-events","topic_type":"task","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":33,"breadcrumb":["Configure a lifecycle event","Building a lifecycle event","Using Lifecycle Events","Lifecycle Events","Employee Journey Management","HR Service Delivery","Employee Service Management"],"tags":["#employee-service-management","#lifecycle-events","#onboarding","#offboarding","#transitions","#type-task"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/employee-service-management/lifecycle-events/configure-hr-lifecycle-event-activity.md"},
